  "atlas-boss_altar-sunrise-canyon-1417--1462": {
    "summary": "Level 40. Boss: Rymek Luke. The Sunrise Canyon is a Boss Altar designed for players of around level 40. It is located atop an isolated plateau in the Mesa.",
    "explanation": "Access\n• Recommended level 40.\n• Required quest: None.\n• Items required: 4 Coyote Fangs.\n\nBosses\n• Rymek Luke\n\nDrops\n• May include the following: 40 Emeralds 7 Gold Ingots Deadeye Redrock Bandana Sundown Poncho Empty Casings Black Sulphur\n\nTips\n• You will want really high walk speed for this fight. Most of rymek luke's attacks are very difficult to dodge without walk speed. Drinking an agility potion from npc shops may help.\n• When the boss is about to do a double shot , try to movement spell left or right from the boss immediately after the boss does the 1st shot.",
    "coverImage": "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/SunriseCanyonAltar.png/300px-SunriseCanyonAltar.png?b0a06b",
    "gallery": [
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/CBBossAltarIcon.png/40px-CBBossAltarIcon.png?918b7d",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/SunriseCanyonAltar.png/300px-SunriseCanyonAltar.png?b0a06b",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/PinpointConcept2.png?5b3504",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/RymekLuke.png/100px-RymekLuke.png?b044b4"
    ],
    "sourceUrl": "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Sunrise_Canyon",
    "tutorials": []
  },
  "atlas-boss_altar-tribal-sanctuary--711--657": {
    "summary": "Level 57. Boss: Tribe Zombie Chief (Lv. 60). The Tribal Sanctuary is a Boss Altar designed for player that are level 57. It is located by a pond at the base of a cliff near Iboju Village.",
    "explanation": "Access\n• Recommended level 57.\n• Required quest: The Passage.\n\nBosses\n• Tribe Zombie Chief (Lv. 60)\n\nTips\n• In general it's good to keep a fair distance to the boss at all times, unless you have to get closer to it in order to deal damage.\n• A weapon with fire damage on it will help kill the Tribal Mystic Zombies quickly, and a weapon with air damage may help you take down the boss faster.",
    "coverImage": "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/TribalSanctuaryAltar.png/300px-TribalSanctuaryAltar.png?58ce1d",
    "gallery": [
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/SiteIcon.png/40px-SiteIcon.png?1dfea2",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/TribalSanctuaryAltar.png/300px-TribalSanctuaryAltar.png?58ce1d",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/PinpointConcept2.png?5b3504",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/TribeZombieChief.png/100px-TribeZombieChief.png?574932",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/TribeZombie%28TribalSanctuary%29.png/100px-TribeZombie%28TribalSanctuary%29.png?85c31a",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/TribeZombieMystic.png/100px-TribeZombieMystic.png?50da26"
    ],
    "sourceUrl": "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Tribal_Sanctuary",
    "tutorials": []
  },
  "atlas-boss_altar-unknown-area-1296--4670": {
    "summary": "Level 99. Boss: Orange Wybel. The Unknown Area is a Boss Altar designed for players of around level 99. It is located beneath the Wybel Island in the Sky Islands.",
    "explanation": "Access\n• Recommended level 99.\n• Location: Unknown Area.\n• Items required: 8 Wybel Fluff.\n\nBosses\n• Orange Wybel\n\nDrops\n• 640 Emeralds and Borange FluffMay include the following: Braker Bonder Stinger Slider Lower\n\nTips\n• Be wary of the pressure plates unless you use a Life Steal or Mana Steal build. In that situation, trigger them as much as you need.\n• Bring other players, preferably mages. If you wish to solo it, bring health and stats pots.\n• Use debuff spells regularly to slow down the Orange Wybel and its minions.\n• During the second and fourth phases, try to keep your distance from the Orange Wybel as much as possible, because fighting is not required to complete these phases.",
    "coverImage": "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/OrangeWybelAltar.png/300px-OrangeWybelAltar.png?4c2733",
    "gallery": [
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/CBBossAltarIcon.png/40px-CBBossAltarIcon.png?918b7d",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/OrangeWybelAltar.png/300px-OrangeWybelAltar.png?4c2733",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/PinpointConcept2.png?5b3504",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/OrangeWybel.png?a2c79c",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/OrangeWybel%28Passive%29.png/100px-OrangeWybel%28Passive%29.png?202670",
      "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/images/thumb/OrangeWybel%28Boss%29.png/100px-OrangeWybel%28Boss%29.png?eec4f8"
    ],
    "sourceUrl": "https://wynncraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Unknown_Area",
    "tutorials": []
  },
