    "explanation": "Stage 1\n• Visit -1067, 44, -5296.\n• Spilt blood of the townsfolk.\n\nStage 2\n• Visit -1008, 43, -5294.\n• Collect the Vial of Blood at the center of Gelibord.\n• Incantations spoken long ago.\n\nStage 3\n• Visit -1082, 42, -5465.\n• Collect the Magical Tome in the first stone house to the right after crossing the bridge to Gelibord's Castle.\n• Soul of the summoner.\n\nStage 4\n• Visit -1082, 52, -5393.\n• Kill the Summoned Rift in front of Referick's house from the quest Realm of Light III - A Headless History.\n• Altar\n\nStage 5\n• Visit -1016, 43, -5424.\n• When death spread across the North... ...various warlocks were attracted to the negative and dark aura. The people of Gelibord could do nothing to stop them.\n• Dialogue:\n• Dark magic was outlawed. Though in poorer areas, it ran rampant...\n• However, many warlocks were amateurs. Their magic had the reverse effect.",
