    "summary": "Water of the Past is a Secret Discovery located near Mount Wynn.",
    "explanation": "Stage 1\n• Visit -303, -1887.\n• Go to the ruins on the West side of Mt. Wynn.\n\nStage 2\n• Visit -306, -1879.\n• To the east of the main entrance of the ruins is a Repair Kit. Collect it for the step after the next.\n\nStage 3\n• Visit -350, -1880.\n\nStage 4\n• Visit -317, -1889.\n• Head up to the first hole that you must patch by right-clicking with the Repair Kit and the Rubble in your inventory.\n\nStage 5\n• Visit -324, -1879.\n• Follow the water movement along until it reaches the next hole, punch the leaves away. Text will show up saying \"Seems like some mechanism was activated...\"\n\nStage 6\n• Visit -316, 67, -1888.\n• Follow the water again and wait for the water-powered cogs to spin. The door, that had an emerald block in it before, should open to the south-east of them.",
